OL,3,APolice slow to respond to Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, says council boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice were slow to react to an
OL,7,F"exceptionally well organised" protest
OL,8,Fthat ground the Port of Dover to a halt
OL,9,Ffor hours, a council boss has said.
OL,11,FKevin Mills, who leads Dover District
OL,12,FCouncil, told the BBC that
OL,13,Fdemonstrators "caught several agencies
OL,14,Fon the hoof" when they arrived on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FHundreds of masked men chanting "stop
OL,18,Fthe boats" blocked roads, causing miles
OL,19,Fof tailbacks and preventing access to
OL,20,Fthe port.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
