OL,3,AGerman far-right set for big win in
OL,4,Aeastern state - exit polls
OL,5,
OL,6,FGermany's AfD is heading for a big
OL,7,Fvictory in the eastern state of
OL,8,FSaxony-Anhalt, far ahead of its
OL,9,Fmainstream arrivals, exit polls say. It
OL,10,Fis not yet clear if that would be
OL,11,Fenough to take power in the state but
OL,12,Fthe AfD says it has won a mandate to
OL,13,Fgovern.
OL,15,FThe far-right party is projected to win
OL,16,F44-44.5% of the vote, far ahead of the
OL,17,Fconservative CDU on 18.5%. The AfD has
OL,18,Fhailed the result as a "historic
OL,19,Foutcome" and the charismatic leader in
OL,20,Fthe state, Ulrich Siegmund, has refused
OL,21,Fto rule with any other party.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
